ed: codex exited 0 but wrote no final message (see agent.err)\" >&2; rc=3; fi\n  rm -rf \"$SH\" \"$SCR\"; return $rc\n}\n\n# Kimi's output goes to Moonshot: its shell runs under sandbox/agent.sb with an empty scratch HOME.\nkimi_run() {"}}}
